title: "The Circuit Breaker That Cried Wolf: Measuring BGP Maximum-Prefix Exceedance and Connectivity Impact"
abstract: >-
  Code and analysis notebooks for a large-scale measurement study of BGP
  maximum-prefix limit exceedance and its connectivity impact, combining 12
  months of RIPE RIS snapshots with PeeringDB metadata and CAIDA AS Rank.
